│                          │ adaptation, blends best and archive fitness to estimate difficulty, and adds exploration  │
│                          │ when progress and population spread are small. Width moves toward larger targets at rate  │
│                          │ 0.45 and smaller targets at 0.20. Persistent memory tracks mean fitness, archive fitness, │
│                          │ and stagnation; archive deterioration increases exploration without requiring switch      │
│                          │ information. Performance remains to be evaluated.                                         │
