│                          │ best-to-mean gap, strengthened by stagnation. This preserves the existing recovery        │
│                          │ mechanism while preventing an isolated elite from prematurely shutting down exploration.  │
│                          │ The floor vanishes as population performance approaches the best return; its effect on    │
